Polynomial long division gives us
\[
\begin{array}{c|ccc}
\multicolumn{2}{r}{x} & +2 \\
\cline{2-4}
2x+3 & 2x^2&+7x&+10 \\
\multicolumn{2}{r}{2x^2} & +3x &   \\
\cline{2-3}
\multicolumn{2}{r}{0} & 4x &  +10 \\
